#: ../../source/docs/custom-build-server.rst:5
#: cd806a94bd0d461aaa4ae32a20600192
msgid "ArduPilot Custom Firmware Builder"
msgstr "ArduPilot 自定义固件构建服务器"

#: ../../source/docs/custom-build-server.rst:8
#: e61b544c2231402fb05077b33d178c3d
msgid "Design"
msgstr "设计"

#: ../../source/docs/custom-build-server.rst:9
#: 30438fb495a24f63a6570256bc59cecc
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot Custom Firmware Builder is a monolithic Flask application "
"running on ArduPilot's autotest server, with Apache WSGI serving as the web "
"server. The application includes a builder thread that continuously consumes"
" build requests from a queue and processes them accordingly."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 自定义固件构建服务器是一个运行在 ArduPilot 自动化测试服务器上的单体 Flask 应用，使用 Apache WSGI 作为"
" Web 服务器。应用包含一个构建线程，持续从队列中消费构建请求并加以处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/custom-build-server.rst:11
#: f675d4aade544aa1a9f873977585b096
msgid ""
"The available versions are listed in a file called `remotes.json`. You can "
"find the schema for the `remotes.json` file `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/CustomBuild/blob/main/remotes.schema.json>`__."
" We also have an automated setup that updates this file with the latest "
"releases from ArduPilot, as well as some tags from certain whitelisted "
"repositories belonging to members of the ArduPilot development team. Below "
"is a diagram illustrating how the `remotes.json` file is updated "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"可用版本列表存储在名为 `remotes.json` 的文件中。`remotes.json` 文件的 schema 可在`此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/CustomBuild/blob/main/remotes.schema.json>`__ "
"查看。我们还设有自动化流程，用于将 ArduPilot 的最新发布版本以及 ArduPilot 开发团队成员白名单仓库的部分标签更新到该文件。下图说明了"
" `remotes.json` 文件的自动更新流程。"

#: ../../source/docs/custom-build-server.rst:45
#: 61022c3342824ef19abee256cce81569
msgid ""
"To obtain the list of boards and available features for a particular "
"version, the application checks out the specific commit of the listed "
"version and then uses the `build_options.py "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/build_options.py>`__"
" and `board_list.py "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/board_list.py>`__"
" files to retrieve the necessary information."
msgstr ""
"为获取特定版本的板卡列表和可用功能，应用会检出该版本对应的特定 commit，然后使用 `build_options.py "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/build_options.py>`__"
" 和 `board_list.py "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/board_list.py>`__"
" 文件获取所需信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/custom-build-server.rst:48
#: d07c2f8af446499e8f31ebe5a7c6419e
msgid "Publishing a tag"
msgstr "发布标签"

#: ../../source/docs/custom-build-server.rst:49
#: 28c0163f93d847939ce696384613e334
msgid ""
"In addition to listing official ArduPilot releases, we also allow "
"development team members to publish tags from their ArduPilot forks to be "
"listed on the custom build server. To publish a tag, the user must be "
"included in the list of whitelisted users. To get whitelisted, add your name"
" `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/CustomBuild/blob/ac24c25cf346e3bfb70a8fb023f23d7c4bf367a1/scripts/fetch_whitelisted_tags.py#L35>`__"
" and create a pull request. Ensure that the name of the fork is `ardupilot`."
msgstr ""
"除列出官方 ArduPilot 发布版本外，我们还允许开发团队成员将其 ArduPilot fork "
"中的标签发布到自定义构建服务器上。要发布标签，用户必须在白名单用户列表中。要加入白名单，请在`此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/CustomBuild/blob/ac24c25cf346e3bfb70a8fb023f23d7c4bf367a1/scripts/fetch_whitelisted_tags.py#L35>`__"
" 添加您的名字并创建一个 pull request。请确保 fork 的名称为 `ardupilot`。"

#: ../../source/docs/custom-build-server.rst:51
#: aa095d5cf8344b278de9f52a99f1fb4e
msgid "The tag you wish to list should follow a specific naming format:"
msgstr "要发布的标签应遵循特定的命名格式："

#: ../../source/docs/custom-build-server.rst:53
#: 850ebc8192b741ffa3efdecd451de45b
msgid ""
"Tags named in the format `custom-build/xyz` are allowed to be built for all "
"vehicles."
msgstr "格式为 `custom-build/xyz` 的标签允许为所有飞行器类型构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/custom-build-server.rst:54
#: 5b6e96e5ca4343e0a99b6c05f0c524ba
msgid ""
"Tags named in the format `custom-build/vehicle/xyz` are allowed to be built "
"only for the specified vehicle."
msgstr "格式为 `custom-build/vehicle/xyz` 的标签仅允许为指定飞行器类型构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/custom-build-server.rst:56
#: 261ef753760946af933baff1a3c523f9
msgid ""
"Examples: - A tag named `custom-build/some-test-work` will be listed under "
"all vehicles. - A tag named `custom-build/Copter/some-test-work` will be "
"listed under Copter only."
msgstr ""
"示例：- 名为 `custom-build/some-test-work` 的标签将在所有飞行器类型下列出。- 名为 `custom-"
"build/Copter/some-test-work` 的标签仅在 Copter 下列出。"

#: ../../source/docs/custom-build-server.rst:60
#: 86f796d65f95406aae2d9d5d92add650
msgid ""
"After this, you can push the tag to your remote repository. The tag will be "
"listed on the server once the cron job that adds these tags runs."
msgstr "完成后，可将标签推送到您的远程仓库。待添加这些标签的定时任务运行后，该标签将出现在服务器列表中。"
